        "tool_name": "update_plan_progress",
        "arguments": {
          "steps": [
            { "index": 1, "state": "done" },
            { "index": 2, "state": "active" },
            { "index": 3, "state": "pending" }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "status",
      "id": "s2",
      "status": "IDLE"
    }
  ],
  "final_status": "IDLE",
  "expect": {
    "live_signal_kind": "idle",
    "stalled_step_index": 2,
    "done_step_index": 1
  },
  "_why": "A build cancelled mid-run (user hit Cancel; the loop stops and status → IDLE). Guards: (1) deriveLiveSignal returns idle — there is no active signal on a halted build; (2) the active step (index 2) becomes stalled so the UI is honest about unfinished work rather than showing a spinning blue icon; (3) the already-done step (index 1) stays done."
